WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
What was really amazing was the type of people you meet,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
the connections you make, some real friendships,
some real, long-lasting relationships,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
and a great combination of industry expertise
that goes far beyond what you can tap into

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
within the standard SEO literature,
research, and journals.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
You'll find something much deeper
and more thought-provoking here.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
And you'll also have a damn good time.
